# CODEBASE — CrazyFreeKick

> Mini-game sút phạt (penalty kick). Đọc file này thay vì quét toàn bộ repo.

## Tổng quan

| Thuộc tính | Giá trị |
|---|---|
| Engine | Cocos Creator **3.8.7** |
| Ngôn ngữ | TypeScript strict (26 file `.ts`) |
| Resolution | 1360×640 |
| Gameplay | 6 level, grid sút 9×4, 11 đội, thủ môn + tường người |
| Legacy | `assets/scripts/main.js` (~3500 dòng CreateJS) — chỉ tham chiếu, không sửa |
| Event bus | `BroadcastReceiver` (không dùng `cc.director`) |
| Asset load | `AssetLoader` (cache Map) — thay cho `ResourceManager` trong RULES |

**Scenes:** `Loading.scene` → `Game.scene`

**RULES.mdc** dùng `GameScene`, `GameManager`, `AssetLoader`.

---

## Cấu trúc thư mục

```
assets/scripts/
├── LoadingScene.ts          # Boot: preload, login API, progress bar
├── GameScene.ts             # MenuPanel ↔ GamePanel, mở popup chọn đội
├── managers/
│   ├── GameManager.ts       # Luật chơi, session state, điều phối kick
│   └── NetworkManager.ts    # HTTP REST + WebSocket generic
├── components/
│   ├── BallCtrl.ts          # Bezier flight, bounce, fadeOut
│   ├── PlayerCtrl.ts        # Anim idle/shot theo team
│   ├── GoalKeeperCtrl.ts    # Anim cứu thủ môn
│   ├── WallCtrl.ts          # Tường người (max 3)
│   ├── ShotIndicatorCtrl.ts # 2 bước tap chọn col/row
│   ├── HUDCtrl.ts           # Score, bonus, kicks, result label
│   ├── AudioController.ts   # Singleton SFX/BGM
│   └── Popup/               # popupSelectTeam, popupNextLevel, popupGameOver, popupGameWin
├── common/
│   ├── GameConfig.ts        # Hằng số, enum, interfaces
│   ├── LevelData.ts         # Grid vị trí level/kick, keeper config
│   ├── GameEvents.ts        # Event name UPPER_CASE
│   ├── GameEventPayloads.ts # Typed payload cho BroadcastReceiver
│   ├── BroadcastReceiver.ts # Pub/sub event
│   ├── Popup.ts             # Base popup show/hide tween
│   └── NumberScrolling.ts   # Tween số trên Label
├── services/AssetLoader.ts  # Load remote/resources + cache
├── utils/Logger.ts          # Wrapper log [tag]
└── i18n/                    # LocalizationManager, LocalizedLabel, LocalizedSprite
```

---

## Luồng scene

```
LoadingScene
  → preload Game scene + 4 popup prefabs
  → POST /login (token từ URL)
  → loadScene('Game')

GameScene
  → MenuPanel (splash tween)
  → popupSelectTeam → GameManager.startGame(teamKey)
  → GamePanel active
```

---

## Luồng một lượt sút (critical path)

1. `GameManager.broadcastKickSetup()` → `ON_KICK_SETUP` → Ball/Player/Wall reposition
2. `GameManager.beginKick()` → `ON_KICK_READY` → `ShotIndicatorCtrl` step 0 (horizontal)
3. Tap → step 1 (vertical) → tap → `GameManager.onShotConfirmed({col, row})`
4. GameManager tính `gShotResult` → `ON_SHOT_START`
5. `PlayerCtrl.playShot()` → anim frame event `onKickFrame()` → `GameManager.onPlayerKickFrame()`
6. `ON_BALL_KICK` + `ON_KEEPER_JUMP` + `ON_WALL_JUMP` (nếu có tường)
7. `BallCtrl` bay xong → `GameManager.onBallLanded()` → `ON_GOAL`/`ON_SAVED`/`ON_OUT`/`ON_WALL_HIT`
8. `HUDCtrl._onResultShow()` tween → `GameManager.controlIfCanContinue()`
9. Win → `popupGameWin` | Over → `popupGameOver` | Next level → `popupNextLevel`

