## Event map (BroadcastReceiver)

Payload types định nghĩa trong `GameEventPayloads.ts`.

| Event | Payload | Emitter → Listener |
|---|---|---|
| `ON_KICK_SETUP` | `IKickSetupPayload` | GameManager → Ball/Player/Wall |
| `ON_KICK_READY` | `number` (levelIndex) | GameManager → ShotIndicatorCtrl |
| `ON_SHOT_START` | `null` | GameManager → PlayerCtrl |
| `ON_BALL_KICK` | `{ targetPos, hitKeeper, hitWall }` | GameManager → BallCtrl |
| `ON_KEEPER_JUMP` | `IKeeperActionInfo` | GameManager → GoalKeeperCtrl |
| `ON_WALL_JUMP` | `null` | GameManager → WallCtrl |
| `ON_GOAL` | `{ score, bonus }` | GameManager → HUDCtrl |
| `ON_SAVED` / `ON_OUT` / `ON_WALL_HIT` | `null` | GameManager → HUDCtrl |
| `ON_SCORE_CHANGED` | `{ score }` | GameManager → HUDCtrl |
| `ON_BONUS_CHANGED` | `{ bonus }` | GameManager → HUDCtrl |
| `ON_KICKS_CHANGED` | `{ kicksLeft }` | GameManager → HUDCtrl |
| `ON_GOALS_CHANGED` | `{ scored, required }` | GameManager → HUDCtrl |
| `ON_LEVEL_COMPLETE` | `{ levelIndex, goalsScored }` | GameManager (broadcast) |
| `ON_GAME_OVER` | `{ score, time }` | GameManager (broadcast) |
| `ON_GAME_WIN` | `{ score, time }` | GameManager (broadcast) |
| `ON_CROWD_EXULT` | `null` | GameManager (broadcast) |
| `ON_EXIT_GAME` | `null` | (external) → GameManager |

**Events khai báo nhưng chưa dùng:** `ON_BOOT_COMPLETE`, `ON_GOTO_SELECT_TEAM`, `ON_TEAM_SELECTED`, `ON_SHOT_CONFIRMED`, `ON_PLAYER_KICK_FRAME`

---

## GameManager — state chính

| Field | Ý nghĩa |
|---|---|
| `gScore`, `gBonus` | Điểm và hệ số thưởng (bonus giảm mỗi frame khi chờ) |
| `gGoalsScored`, `gGoalsRequired` | Bàn ghi / bàn cần ghi trong level |
| `gKicksLeft` | Lượt sút còn lại |
| `gLevelIndex`, `gKickIndex` | Level hiện tại (0–5), lượt sút (0–4) |
| `gTeamKey` | Team string (`argentina`, `brazil`, …) |
| `gShotResult` | Kết quả cú sút vừa tính (`IShotResult`) |
| `isReadyToKick` | Guard chống double-tap |

**Public API:** `startGame`, `startNextLevel`, `beginKick`, `onShotConfirmed`, `onPlayerKickFrame`, `onBallLanded`, `controlIfCanContinue`

