## Config quan trọng

**GameConfig.ts**
- `RANGE_WIDTH=9`, `RANGE_HEIGHT=4`, `NUM_LEVEL=6`
- `BONUS_START=1000`, `BONUS_DECREASE=1.8`
- `KeeperAction` enum (8 hướng cứu + OUT)
- `TeamIndex` / `TEAM_KEYS` (11 đội)
- `KEEPER_ACTION_INFO`, `userDATA`

**LevelData.ts**
- `LEVEL_INFO_LIST` — goalToScore + kickLeft mỗi level
- `BALL_POS_GRID`, `PLAYER_POS_GRID`, `WALL_POS_GRID`
- `KEEPER_COL_CONFIG` — catchPercent + rowActions theo col 0–8

---

## API (NetworkManager)

| Endpoint | Gọi từ | Body |
|---|---|---|
| `POST /login` | LoadingScene | `{ token }` |
| `POST /saveScore` | popupGameOver, popupGameWin | `{ username, score, time }` |

Base URL: `https://apiminigame-kh.gamebatta.com/api-minigame` (DEFAULT_CONFIG)

Helper: `PopupHelper.saveScore(score, time)` — gom logic save chung.

