## i18n

- Ngôn ngữ: `vi`, `en`, `lo`, `my`, `kr`
- URL param: `?lang=en&token=...`
- `LocalizedLabel` — key → Label/RichText
- `LocalizedSprite` — map sprite theo `currentLang` (`vi`/`en`/…)

